{"id":"payaso","lemma":"payaso","pos":"adj","rank":2208,"glosses":["clownish; buffoonlike"],"ipa":"/paˈʝaso/","forms":{"feminine":"payasa","masculinePlural":"payasos","femininePlural":"payasas"},"order":2231,"examples":[{"text":"Todos estaban vestidos de payaso.","en":"Everyone was dressed like a clown.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/730305","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"dressed","l":"vestido"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Mi amigo verdaderamente es un payaso.","en":"My friend is really a clown.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"friend"},{"g":"truthfully"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"El payaso volvió al circo.","en":"The clown went back to the circus.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to return","l":"volver"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"circus"}]}]}